{"type":"text","timestamp":1790319961021,"sessionID":"ses_f28a3c12fffePHeHn1dG1kE4v3","part":{"id":"prt_0d762a3b4001F5HjvfkqmLGay5","messageID":"msg_0d75ffe9b001CU2t2rTw6ktwBK","sessionID":"ses_f28a3c12fffePHeHn1dG1kE4v3","type":"text","text":"Now let me refine the shader with the final structure — combining the reconstruction (diagonal `blend_diag`, texel class test, opposite-pair blending) with border detection on each neighbor so the smoothing is genuinely visible along all borders.","time":{"start":1790319961012,"end":1790319961014},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_b13a82160e2b4e608e4e03852fad6c3d_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790319961046,"sessionID":"ses_f28a3c12fffePHeHn1dG1kE4v3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_21_91be9c9c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"shader_type spatial;\n\nuniform sampler2D subview_image: source_color;\nuniform float threshold = 0.1;\nuniform float aa_scale = 17.6;\nuniform float base_line_thickness = 0.38197;\n\n// Blend between the current color and the reference color of the\n// neighbouring texel (tx, ty = -1 / 0 / +1) along the diagonal line that\n// joins the two opposite corners of the texel side shared with that\n// neighbour. This is the diagonal blending step used by the HQX-style\n// border smoothing below.\nvec3 blend_diag(vec3 col, vec3 ref, vec2 uv, int tx, int ty, ivec2 ts, float tt) {\n\tvec2 texel = vec2(tx, ty);\n\t// Position of the pixel inside the texel (and beyond), in [-1, 1]^2.\n\tvec2 fp = clamp(tt * (uv * vec2(ts) - 0.5) - fract(uv * vec2(ts)) + 0.5 - texel, -1.0, 1.0);\n\t// Distance from the diagonal line between the two corners.\n\tfloat d = abs(fp.x * float(ty) - fp.y * float(tx)) / sqrt(2.0);\n\tfloat t = clamp(d + base_line_thickness, 0.0, 1.0);\n\treturn mix(ref, col, t);\n}\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tivec2 ts = textureSize(subview_image, 0);\n\t// Texel-space coordinates (bottom-left origin) of the current pixel and\n\t// of the texel that contains it. The texels are read with texelFetch.\n\tvec2 tp = UV * vec2(ts) - 0.5;\n\ttp.y = float(ts.y) - 1.0 - tp.y;\n\tivec2 base = ivec2(floor(tp));\n\n\tvec3 cc = texelFetch(subview_image, base, 0).rgb;                // center\n\tvec3 cf = texelFetch(subview_image, base + ivec2(0, 1), 0).rgb;  // north\n\tvec3 cw = texelFetch(subview_image, base + ivec2(1, 0), 0).rgb;  // east\n\tvec3 cz = texelFetch(subview_image, base + ivec2(-1, 0), 0).rgb; // west\n\tvec3 cp = texelFetch(subview_image, base + ivec2(0, -1), 0).rgb; // south\n\n\tfloat ss = aa_scale;\n\tfloat tt = abs(float(ts.x) - float(ts.y)) + max(float(ts.x), float(ts.y));\n\n\tbool nb = distance(cc, cf) > threshold;\n\tbool sb = distance(cc, cp) > threshold;\n\tbool eb = distance(cc, cw) > threshold;\n\tbool wb = distance(cc, cz) > threshold;\n\n\t// HQX-style border smoothing: whenever the neighbors across a texel\n\t// side belong to a different region, blend their color into the center\n\t// along the diagonal of that side.\n\tvec3 color = cc;\n\tif (nb && sb) {\n\t\tcolor = blend_diag(color, mix(cf, cp, 0.5), UV, 0, 1, ts, tt);\n\t} else if (nb) {\n\t\tcolor = blend_diag(color, cf, UV, 0, 1, ts, tt);\n\t} else if (sb) {\n\t\tcolor = blend_diag(color, cp, UV, 0, 1, ts, tt);\n\t}\n\tif (eb && wb) {\n\t\tcolor = blend_diag(color, mix(cw, cz, 0.5), UV, 1, 0, ts, tt);\n\t} else if (eb) {\n\t\tcolor = blend_diag(color, cw, UV, 1, 0, ts, tt);\n\t} else if (wb) {\n\t\tcolor = blend_diag(color, cz, UV, 1, 0, ts, tt);\n\t}\n\n\tALBEDO = color;\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/assets/shaders/map3d.gdshader"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/assets/shaders/map3d.gdshader","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"workspace/assets/shaders/map3d.gdshader","time":{"start":1790319961018,"end":1790319961030}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write_21_91be9c9c"}},"id":"prt_0d762a3b7001fO6DyTmFljAmvC","sessionID":"ses_f28a3c12fffePHeHn1dG1kE4v3","messageID":"msg_0d75ffe9b001CU2t2rTw6ktwBK"}}
